场景：
你两周前给一位教授发过邮件，询问项目会议时间。他一直没回。现在你要发一封礼貌的跟进邮件。

第一次写：
Dear Professor Klimas,
I hope this email finds you well.
I send you an email two weeks ago. But I didn’t get feedback. So, I just kindly ask you again about our meeting time.
Thanks a lot.
Your sincerely,
Shaokang Su

AI修改：
Subject: Follow-up: Meeting Request for Power Engineering Project
Dear Professor Klimas,
I hope this email finds you well.
I am writing to follow up on my previous email sent two weeks ago regarding our project meeting. I understand you may be very busy. Could you please let me know the exact time of our meeting?
Thank you for your time and help. I look forward to your reply.
Yours sincerely,
Shaokang Su

学到：
1.英语里，当定语从句的主语和先行词（被修饰词）是被动关系时（邮件是被发送的），就可以把 which was 省略，只留过去分词 sent，直接放在名词后面，让句子更简洁。这是学术和职场写作里的高频高级用法。
完整版：The project which was completed last week was successful.
省略版：The project completed last week was successful.
